,"url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPeEVwbUdMN3pEX0tRV3hnTUU0cDBVYjdrOEpERDZDZlI3Q3VteUdpd09vaVdxZzlEdEtvdjF0Z2FSM0F6Z0hocGVZbXF4dTFDNFRWMDF3RTVJanp3ZUVWMTdOdkc2QW5JSlo5M2oyQlNmVTl1OFIxUTM3enRPbE1ILXk0T1ZURm9IRGhtNVd0Y1NDWEVUS0ZtVjZUaTBOekk3MUcw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"Alphabet 的這項人工智慧策略看起來一天比一天好"},{"title":"[Click e-Stock] Ahead of Alphabet's Q3 Results... What Are Market Expectations?","src":"아시아경제","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE8zYnVxOXVmQ2ZZdnVNWF9EdkdMNlpJTk9sOG9wMlE0OWNidmpVRDVvdmlTbU00Z2o2ZzcwejRnV2FKUjM4a25OU0NaSjlOLVhBN1g5Q1k3RU9VaWM0bGFnM00ybzY?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"[點選 e-Stock] Alphabet 第三季業績公佈…市場預期是什麼？"}],"themes":[{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":7},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":4},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-05","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1652044/000165204426000018/goog-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"As our founders Larry and Sergey wrote in the original founders' letter, \"Google is not a conventional company. We do not intend to become one.\" That unconventional spirit has been a driving force throughout our history, inspiring us to tackle big problems and invest in moonshots. It led us to be a pioneer in the development of artificial intelligence (AI) and, since 2016, be an AI-first company. We continue this work under the leadership of Alphabet and Google CEO, Sundar Pichai.","zh":"正如我們的創辦人拉里和謝爾蓋在最初的創始人信中所寫的那樣，「谷歌不是一家傳統公司。我們不打算成為一家傳統公司。」這種非傳統精神一直是我們歷史上的驅動力，激勵我們解決重大問題並投資於登月計劃。它使我們成為人工智慧 (AI) 開發的先驅，並自 2016 年起成為一家人工智慧優先的公司。我們在 Alphabet 和 Google 執行長 Sundar Pichai 的領導下繼續這項工作。"},{"en":"Alphabet is a collection of businesses — the largest of which is Google. We report Google in two segments, Google Services and Google Cloud, and all non-Google businesses collectively as Other Bets. Supporting these businesses, we have centralized certain AI-related research and development focused on advanced research in AI and developing the frontier models that serve our businesses, which is reported in Alphabet-level activities. Alphabet's structure is about helping each of our businesses prosper through strong leaders and independence.","zh":"Alphabet 是企業的集合體——其中最大的是Google。我們將Google分為兩個部分：Google服務和Google雲，並將所有非Google業務統稱為「其他賭注」。為了支援這些業務，我們集中了某些與人工智慧相關的研究和開發，重點關注人工智慧的高級研究和開發服務於我們業務的前沿模型，這在 Alphabet 級別的活動中進行了報告。 Alphabet 的結構旨在透過強有力的領導者和獨立性來幫助我們的每項業務繁榮發展。"},{"en":"The Internet is one of the world's most powerful equalizers; it propels ideas, people, and businesses large and small. Our mission to organize the world's information and make it universally accessible and useful is as relevant today as it was when we were founded in 1998. Since then, we have evolved from a company that helps people find answers to a company that also helps people get things done.","zh":"網路是世界上最強大的均衡器之一；它推動著大大小小的想法、人才和企業。我們的使命是整合全球訊息，讓所有人都能存取和使用這些訊息，這項使命在今天與我們 1998 年成立時一樣重要。從那時起，我們從一家幫助人們找到答案的公司發展成為一家也幫助人們完成工作的公司。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Our business is characterized by rapid change as well as new and disruptive technologies. We face formidable competition in every aspect of our business, including but not limited to, from:","zh":"我們業務的特點是快速變化以及新的顛覆性技術。我們在業務的各個方面都面臨著激烈的競爭，包括但不限於："},{"en":"vertical search engines and e-commerce providers for queries on topics such as those related to travel, jobs, and health, which users may navigate directly to rather than go through Google;","zh":"垂直搜尋引擎和電子商務提供者，用於查詢與旅行、工作和健康相關的主題，用戶可以直接導航到這些主題，而不是透過Google；"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Google Services","val":342721000000,"zh":"Google服務"},{"name":"Google Cloud","val":58705000000,"zh":"Google雲"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":1537000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":402836000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":194229000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":117152000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":67680000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Americas Excluding United States","val":23902000000,"zh":"美洲（不包括美國）"}],"total":402836000000}},"peers":["AVGO","NFLX","BABA","V","AMD"]}}